<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>تفاصيل الاشتراك - <%= t('brand_name') %></title>
    <meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" name="viewport">
    
    <!-- Favicon -->
    <link href="/img/favicon.ico" rel="icon">

    <!-- Google Web Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Outfit:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Lobster+Two:wght@700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <!-- Icon Font Stylesheet -->
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/5.10.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

    <!-- Libraries Stylesheet -->
    <link href="/lib/animate/animate.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

    <!-- Customized Bootstrap Stylesheet -->
    <link href="/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

    <!-- Template Stylesheet -->
    <link href="/css/style.css" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #FE5D37;
            --secondary: #FFF0ED;
            --light: #F8F9FA;
            --dark: #000B1C;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f7f9fc;
        }

        .lobster-font { font-family: 'Lobster Two', cursive; }
        .outfit-font { font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; }

        .page-header {
            background: #fff;
            padding: 2rem 0;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            box-shadow: 0 0.25rem 0.75rem rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }

        .btn-back {
            background: var(--light);
            border: 1px solid #dee2e6;
            padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--dark);
        }

        .btn-back:hover {
            background: var(--primary);
            color: #fff;
            border-color: var(--primary);
        }

        .content-card {
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 1.5rem;
            padding: 2rem;
            box-shadow: 0 0.25rem 0.75rem rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            border: 1px solid #f1f1f1;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .card-title {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--dark);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .info-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .info-item {
            padding: 1rem;
            background: #f8fafc;
            border-radius: 1rem;
            border: 1px solid #eef0f2;
        }

        .info-label {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #6c757d;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .info-value {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--dark);
        }

        .badge-status {
            padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
            border-radius: 2rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        .badge-pending {
            background: #fff3cd;
            color: #856404;
        }

        .badge-confirmed {
            background: var(--secondary);
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        .badge-paid {
            background: #d1f4e0;
            color: #22c55e;
        }

        .badge-rejected {
            background: #f8d7da;
            color: #dc3545;
        }

        .badge-awaiting {
            background: #cfe2ff;
            color: #0d6efd;
        }

        .alert-payment {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #cfe2ff 0%, #e7f1ff 100%);
            border: 2px solid #0d6efd;
            border-radius: 1.25rem;
            padding: 1.5rem;
        }

        .btn-payment {
            background: #22c55e;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
            border-radius: 2rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            border: none;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .btn-payment:hover {
            background: #16a34a;
            color: #fff;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 0.5rem 1rem rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.3);
        }

        .sessions-table {
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 1rem;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .table-custom thead th {
            background: var(--secondary);
            color: var(--primary);
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            padding: 1rem;
            border: none;
        }

        .table-custom tbody td {
            padding: 1rem;
            vertical-align: middle;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f1f1;
        }

        .table-custom tbody tr:hover {
            background: #f8fafc;
        }

        .table-custom tbody tr.session-past {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            color: #6c757d;
        }

        .btn-join {
            background: #22c55e;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
            border-radius: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .btn-join:hover {
            background: #16a34a;
            color: #fff;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .empty-state {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 3rem 2rem;
            background: #f8fafc;
            border-radius: 1.5rem;
        }

        .empty-state i {
            font-size: 3rem;
            opacity: 0.3;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: var(--dark);
        }

        .locked-section {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff3cd 0%, #fff8e1 100%);
            border: 2px solid #ffc107;
            border-radius: 1.25rem;
            padding: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .locked-section h5 {
            font-weight: 900;
            color: #856404;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .locked-section p {
            color: #856404;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <% 
        const requestDetails = locals.requestDetails; 
        
        function getStatusBadge(status) {
            switch(status) {
                case 'pending': return { text: 'قيد المراجعة', class: 'badge-pending' };
                case 'confirmed': return { text: 'تمت الموافقة', class: 'badge-confirmed' };
                case 'paid': return { text: 'تم الدفع بنجاح', class: 'badge-paid' };
                case 'rejected': return { text: 'مرفوض', class: 'badge-rejected' };
                case 'awaiting_payment': return { text: 'بانتظار الدفع', class: 'badge-awaiting' };
                default: return { text: 'غير معروف', class: 'badge-pending' };
            }
        }

        const badge = getStatusBadge(requestDetails.status);
        const canViewSessions = requestDetails.status === 'paid' || requestDetails.status === 'confirmed';
    %>

    <!-- Page Header -->
    <div class="page-header">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3">
                <a href="#" onclick="history.back(); return false;" class="btn-back">
                    <i class="fas fa-arrow-right me-2"></i>
                    العودة لجميع الطلبات
                </a>
            </div>
            <h4 class="mb-2 text-primary fw-900 lobster-font">
                <i class="fas fa-file-invoice me-2"></i>
                تفاصيل الطلب (<%= requestDetails._id.toString().slice(0, 8) %>)
            </h4>
            <p class="text-muted mb-0">تفاصيل انضمامك لكورس <strong><%= requestDetails.courseId.title %></strong></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="container pb-5">
        <!-- Order Summary -->
        <div class="content-card animate__animated animate__fadeInUp">
            <h5 class="card-title">
                <i class="fas fa-info-circle text-primary me-2"></i>
                ملخص الطلب والكورس
            </h5>

            <div class="info-grid">
                <div class="info-item">
                    <div class="info-label">
                        <i class="fas fa-book me-1"></i>
                        الكورس
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-value"><%= requestDetails.courseId.title %></div>
                </div>

                <div class="info-item">
                    <div class="info-label">
                        <i class="fas fa-calendar-week me-1"></i>
                        عدد الحصص بالشهر
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-value outfit-font"><%= requestDetails.numberOfSessionsPerMonth %></div>
                </div>

                <div class="info-item">
                    <div class="info-label">
                        <i class="fas fa-money-bill-wave me-1"></i>
                        المبلغ الإجمالي
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-value text-success outfit-font"><%= requestDetails.totalAmount.toFixed(2) %> ريال</div>
                </div>

                <div class="info-item">
                    <div class="info-label">
                        <i class="fas fa-clipboard-check me-1"></i>
                        حالة الطلب
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <span class="badge-status <%= badge.class %>">
                            <%= badge.text %>
                        </span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <% if (requestDetails.status === 'awaiting_payment') { %>
                <div class="alert-payment mt-4">
                    <h6 class="fw-bold mb-2">
                        <i class="fas fa-exclamation-circle me-2"></i>
                        الإجراء المطلوب:
                    </h6>
                    <p class="mb-3">يرجى إتمام عملية الدفع لتأكيد مقعدك وبدء عرض جدول الحصص.</p>
                    <a href="/student/pay/<%= requestDetails._id %>" class="btn-payment">
                        <i class="fas fa-credit-card me-2"></i>
                        الذهاب لصفحة الدفع
                    </a>
                </div>
            <% } %>
        </div>

        <!-- Sessions Schedule -->
        <% if (canViewSessions) { %>
            <div class="content-card animate__animated animate__fadeInUp" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
                <h5 class="card-title">
                    <i class="fas fa-calendar-alt text-primary me-2"></i>
                    جدول الحصص والمواعيد
                </h5>

                <div class="table-responsive sessions-table">
                    <table class="table table-custom mb-0">
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th># الحصة</th>
                                <th>التاريخ</th>
                                <th>الوقت (بتوقيت الرياض)</th>
                                <th>المدة</th>
                                <th>رابط الانضمام</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <% requestDetails.sessions.forEach(function(session, index) { 
                                const sessionDateRaw = session.date;
                                const sessionTime = session.time;
                                
                                const dateObject = new Date(sessionDateRaw);
                                const year = dateObject.getUTCFullYear();
                                const month = dateObject.getUTCMonth();
                                const day = dateObject.getUTCDate();
                                
                                const timeParts = sessionTime.split(':');
                                const hour = parseInt(timeParts[0]);
                                const minute = parseInt(timeParts[1]);
                                
                                const sessionStartTime = new Date();
                                sessionStartTime.setUTCFullYear(year, month, day);
                                sessionStartTime.setUTCHours(hour, minute, 0, 0);
                                
                                const now = new Date();
                                const oneHourFromNow = new Date(now.getTime() + (60 * 60 * 1000));
                                
                                const isTooSoon = sessionStartTime.getTime() > oneHourFromNow.getTime();
                                const isReadyOrPassed = sessionStartTime.getTime() <= oneHourFromNow.getTime();
                                const isPast = sessionStartTime.getTime() < now.getTime();
                            %>
                                <tr class="<%= isPast ? 'session-past' : '' %>">
                                    <td class="fw-bold"><%= index + 1 %></td>
                                    <td class="fw-600">
                                        <%= sessionDateRaw.toLocaleDateString('ar-EG', { weekday: 'long', year: 'numeric', month: 'numeric', day: 'numeric' }) %>
                                    </td>
                                    <td class="fw-bold outfit-font"><%= session.time %></td>
                                    <td class="outfit-font"><%= requestDetails.selectedPriceOption %> دقيقة</td>
                                    <td>
                                        <% if (!isPast) { %>
                                            <% const bookingId = requestDetails._id; %>
                                            <a href="/student/session-details/<%= bookingId %>/<%= session._id %>" class="btn-join">
                                                <i class="fas fa-video me-2"></i>
                                                الانضمام الآن
                                            </a>
                                        <% } else { %>
                                            <span class="text-muted">
                                                <i class="fas fa-check-circle me-1"></i>
                                                انتهت
                                            </span>
                                        <% } %>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            <% }); %>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>

                <% if (requestDetails.sessions.length === 0) { %>
                    <div class="empty-state mt-3">
                        <i class="fas fa-calendar-times"></i>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0">لم يتم تحديد جدول حصص بعد. يرجى التواصل مع الإدارة.</p>
                    </div>
                <% } %>
            </div>
        <% } else { %>
            <div class="locked-section animate__animated animate__fadeInUp" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
                <i class="fas fa-lock fs-1 text-warning mb-3"></i>
                <h5>
                    <i class="fas fa-info-circle me-2"></i>
                    جدول الحصص غير متاح حالياً
                </h5>
                <p class="mb-2">يظهر جدول الحصص ومواعيدها فقط بعدما يتم <strong>تأكيد دفع</strong> الرسوم أو <strong>الموافقة النهائية</strong> على طلبك.</p>
                <p class="mb-0">الحالة الحالية: <strong><%= badge.text %></strong></p>
            </div>
        <% } %>
    </div>

    <!-- Scripts -->
    <script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.4.1.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.0.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>